<script setup lang="ts">import { computed } from 'vue'; import type { Category, RecordItem } from '@/types'; import { formatMoney } from '@/utils/money'; const props = defineProps<{ record: RecordItem; category?: Category; parentCategory?: Category }>(); const amount = computed(() => `${props.record.type === 'expense' ? '-' : '+'}${formatMoney(props.record.amount)}`); const categoryName = computed(() => props.category ? (props.parentCategory ? `${props.parentCategory.name} · ${props.category.name}` : props.category.name) : '已删除分类')</script>
<template><div class="record-row"><span class="record-icon">{{ category?.icon || '📦' }}</span><div class="record-main"><strong>{{ categoryName }}</strong><small>{{ record.remark || '无备注' }}</small></div><strong :class="record.type">{{ amount }}</strong></div></template>
